   "contentDescription": "A woman with light hair and cream-colored blouse sits in Lufthansa Allegris Business Class"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Lufthansa Allegris: What Type of Passenger Are You?",
   "size": "EXTRA_LARGE",
   "variant": "HEADLINE"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>15. September 2026 | 2 min read | Lufthansa Editorial Team</b>",
   "size": "SMALL",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Do you belong to the creative jet set, or are you more at home in the world of business? We have compiled a brief typology of Lufthansa Allegris passengers.</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "The Film Enthusiast",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "HEADLINE"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "She knows Oscar winners by heart and spends every spare minute at her local arthouse cinema. On board, every long-haul flight becomes a blockbuster: more than 300 movies in 4K await on the 13.3-inch screen, best enjoyed with her own premium headphones connected via Bluetooth. Time really does fly.",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/discover-allegris/lufthansa-allegris-what-type-of-passenger-are-you/lh_app_allegris_film-enthusiast_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "A woman with headphones looks through a screen into space"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "The Entrepreneur",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "HEADLINE"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "His office? Anywhere. Between meetings with investors and producers, he runs his business from 35,000 feet. In Premium Economy, the hard-shell seat, generous legroom, power outlet, USB ports, and wireless charging keep both his devices – and ultimately him – fully recharged.",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/discover-allegris/lufthansa-allegris-what-type-of-passenger-are-you/lh_app_allegris_entrepreneur_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "View of a man with glasses from below through a transparent keyboard on which he is typing"
  },
  {
   "type": "spacer",
   "size": "MEDIUM"
  },
