  {
   "type": "spacer",
   "size": "MEDIUM"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "The Fashion Designer",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "HEADLINE"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "For this passenger, every aisle is a runway and every flight a source of inspiration. In the Business Class Extra Space Seat, the large side table becomes a design studio, while the privacy screen and heated and cooled seat create the perfect setting for uninterrupted creativity. By the time the plane lands, her next collection often has too.",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/discover-allegris/lufthansa-allegris-what-type-of-passenger-are-you/lh_app_allegris_fashion-designer_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "A woman with glasses sits among other passengers in Lufthansa Allegris Business Class talking to a male flight attendant."
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "The Power Couple",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "HEADLINE"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "They think they've seen it all. Maybe they have. But the First Class Suite Plus still raises the bar. Dinner feels like a Michelin-starred experience, the seats transform into a double bed, and a movie on the 43-inch screen rounds off the evening. The only downside? The landing always comes too soon.",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/discover-allegris/lufthansa-allegris-what-type-of-passenger-are-you/lh_app_allegris_power-couple_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "A female couple sits opposite each other at a set table and eats a meal in Lufthansa Allegris First Class"
  },
